WEST PAPUA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF TAMBRAUW REGENCY

NUMBER 3 OF 2016

CONCERNING

PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN FROM ACTS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF TAMBRAUW,

Considering that acts and treatment of violence against women and children constitute actions that violate the rights and dignity of women and children as human beings; that the implementation of prevention and protection for women and children as victims of acts of violence in Tambrauw Regency has not been carried out optimally; that based on the considerations as referred to in letters a and b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women and Children From Acts of Violence;

